# Case Studies

## 🏥 Law Firm – Secure Document Intelligence System

**Challenge:** A mid-sized law firm had 5,000+ case documents. Associates were spending 45 minutes per search just to find relevant precedents.

**Solution:** I built a private, secure RAG system using:

- LlamaIndex for ingestion
- SplatRag for SOTA retrieval (0.78 nDCG@10)
- AWS Bedrock Knowledge Bases with Guardrails for PII redaction
- VPC self-hosting — data never leaves their control

**Results:**

- ⏱️ 45 min → 2 min (95% faster)
- ✅ Zero data breaches in 6 months
- 📈 95% associate satisfaction

---

## 🏭 Manufacturing – Vision-Enabled Maintenance Agent

**Challenge:** Field engineers were spending hours diagnosing equipment issues, and errors were costly.

**Solution:** I built a vision-enabled AI agent using:

- LiveKit Agents with video track subscription
- Gemini Live for multimodal understanding
- LlamaIndex for maintenance docs RAG
- VPC self-hosting for complete data security

**Results:**

- ⚡ 40% faster issue resolution
- 📉 30% reduction in maintenance errors
- 💰 $45,000/year saved in downtime costs

---

## 📞 HVAC – 24/7 AI Voice Agent

**Challenge:** 70% of after-hours emergency calls went to voicemail. Customers frustrated. Revenue leaking.

**Solution:** I built a voice agent using:

- LiveKit Agents for real-time voice
- OpenAI Realtime API for natural conversation
- active-call (self-hosted SIP gateway) for phone integration
- AWS Bedrock for secure LLM access

**Results:**

- 📞 70% reduction in missed calls
- ⏱️ 15+ hours/week saved by dispatchers
- 😊 95% customer satisfaction
- 💰 ROI in under 60 days

---

## 💼 B2B SaaS – Multi-Agent Lead Generation System

**Challenge:** 5 SDRs spending 40+ hours/week on manual lead research and outreach. Not selling. Just typing.

**Solution:** I built a multi-agent system using:

- CrewAI for role-based agents
- LangGraph for state management
- Researcher Agent → finds leads
- Writer Agent → drafts emails (95% accuracy)
- Critic Agent → reviews tone & spam triggers

**Results:**

- 📈 3x qualified leads
- ⏱️ 20+ hours/week saved per SDR
- 📧 133% increase in email open rates

---

## 🏢 Real Estate – AI Property Management Agent

**Challenge:** Property managers spending hours on tenant inquiries, maintenance scheduling, and document management.

**Solution:** I built a multi-agent system that:

- Automates tenant communication via WhatsApp and email
- Schedules maintenance work orders
- Manages lease documents and contracts
- Provides instant property information to tenants

**Results:**

- ⏱️ 15+ hours/week saved
- 📈 95% tenant satisfaction
- 🔄 50% faster maintenance response times

---

## 🏛️ Legal – AI Contract Analysis Agent

**Challenge:** Legal team spending hours reviewing contracts for compliance and risk.

**Solution:** I built a secure RAG system that:

- Ingests and analyzes contracts
- Extracts key clauses, dates, and parties
- Identifies compliance risks automatically
- Provides summaries with cited sources

**Results:**

- ⏱️ 80% faster contract review
- 📈 95% accuracy in risk detection
- 🔒 Full VPC self-hosting — data never leaves control
